{"seq":34,"slug":"cloud-database-selection-patterns","title":"云数据库选型模式","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"云数据库选型模式\">云数据库选型模式</h1><p>当团队面对一个新项目或者一次数据层重构时，最棘手的决策往往不是「用哪个版本」，而是「用哪一类数据库」。托管关系型、分布式 SQL、文档存储、宽列、时序、图、向量——2026 年云厂商提供的选项已经超过 60 种 SKU，选错的成本以月计的迁移工期和六位数的额外账单来衡量。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>选型决策本身</strong>：从工作负载特征出发，经过 CAP 取舍分析和成本建模，最终落到具体的产品对比与运维策略。它不深入单一数据库的内部实现（那是 database-systems hub 的范畴），也不覆盖分布式系统的理论推导（属于 distributed-systems hub），更不讨论跨越数据流水线的端到端架构（data-intensive-applications hub 的领地）。相反，它回答的问题是：「给定我的读写比例、一致性要求、预算和团队规模，我应该选什么？」</p>\n<p>建议的学习路径：先完成「选型框架」章节建立方法论，再按需深入「关系型数据库」或「NoSQL 与专用库」两个产品对比章节，最后阅读「运维与迁移」章节为落地做准备。前置知识包括基本的 SQL 操作经验、对 CAP 定理的初步了解，以及至少一次使用云托管数据库的实践经历。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"selection-framework","title":"选型框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workload-analysis-methodology","title":"工作负载分析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/workload-analysis-methodology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cap-theorem-tradeoffs","title":"CAP 定理与取舍决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cap-theorem-tradeoffs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-performance-modeling","title":"成本与性能建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/selection-framework/cost-performance-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"relational-databases","title":"关系型数据库","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"managed-rds-comparison","title":"托管关系型数据库服务对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/managed-rds-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aurora-spanner-cockroach","title":"Aurora、Spanner 与 CockroachDB 架构对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/aurora-spanner-cockroach"},{"seq":3,"slug":"read-replica-sharding","title":"读副本与分片策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/relational-databases/read-replica-sharding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nosql-specialized","title":"NoSQL 与专用数据库","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"document-keyvalue-stores","title":"文档数据库与键值存储选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/document-keyvalue-stores"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wide-column-timeseries","title":"宽列数据库与时序数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/wide-column-timeseries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-vector-databases","title":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/graph-vector-databases"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations-migration","title":"运维与迁移","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"migration-strategy-patterns","title":"数据库迁移策略与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/migration-strategy-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-database-polyglot","title":"多数据库混用架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dbaas-monitoring-tuning","title":"DBaaS 监控与调优实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/dbaas-monitoring-tuning"}]}]}